    "provenance": "GENUINE Inspect output: written by the real inspect_ai writer (see inspect_ai_version) running fully offline against the mockllm/model provider, which returns canned strings and makes no network call. The FILE FORMAT is therefore real and not reconstructed by us. The MODEL RESPONSES are mock placeholders and carry no evaluative meaning whatsoever \u2014 the accuracy in this log is 0.0 and means nothing. Reproduce with fixtures/demo_task.py.",
